# Template-ready denylist example
#
# In a working instance, .template-ready-denylist.local (untracked) is generated
# from owner_identity in .github/harness.yml plus the optional repo secret
# TEMPLATE_READY_DENYLIST_EXTRA.
#
# For local development, copy this file to .template-ready-denylist.local and
# replace placeholders with your actual denied terms.
#
# One term per line; # starts a comment; blank lines are skipped.

<owner_identity>
@<owner_identity>
<owner-email>
<owner-full-name>
